<title>THAILAND: Alphatec sets 6.50 baht 1996 div.</title>
<headline>Alphatec sets 6.50 baht 1996 div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  6.50  vs  11.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 1, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 21, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Alphatec Electronics Plc is an electronics and semiconductor manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-652-0642)</p>
</text>
